# Pavel's Research (Q120), cond 1 to 12: a level 50 character that finished Resurrection of an Old
# Manager (Q114, its journal seeded) accepts at the pile of stones; Yumi, Wendy and the
# stones pass Pavel's flower around, and the north weather master's riddles (both answers right,
# then all three questions read) end at cond 12. The stones, Wendy and Yumi also list Q114, so
# their dialog goes through the quest chooser. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q120_pavels_research.golden
character Researcher 50
quest Q114_ResurrectionOfAnOldManager <state>=COMPLETED
script quest.Q114_ResurrectionOfAnOldManager
script quest.Q120_PavelsResearch
item 8058 8059 8060 8290 8291 8292 854
page default/32046.htm
page default/32047.htm
page default/32041.htm
page default/32042.htm
page default/32043.htm
page default/32044.htm
